post_install() {
  cat <<'EOF'
waysaver is installed but not enabled. Each user starts it, now and at
every login, with:
  systemctl --user enable --now waysaver
or, for every user at once (as root):
  systemctl --global enable waysaver
To change the idle time or the theme: systemctl --user edit waysaver
Themes are in /usr/share/waysaver/themes; see /usr/share/doc/waysaver/README.md.
Sessions without graphical-session.target (XFCE, LXQt, labwc...) need it in
their autostart instead: /usr/bin/waysaver 300 blank
EOF
}
